<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_切割、锯削与钻孔手工工具 (Cutting, Sawing & Boring Tools)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 97 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='22%'>单词 (英 / 法性数完整形态)</th><th width='14%'>音标 (英 / 法 IPA)</th><th width='22%'>中文释义</th><th width='24%'>英文定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='6%'>词频</th><th width='12%'>实物配图</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>drill</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la perceuse<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 drill</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/dril/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/pɛʁsøz/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('drill', 'la perceuse')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 钻孔机, 钻子, 播种机, 粗斜纹布</td><td class='def-en'>a tool with a sharp point and cutting edges for making holes in hard materials (usually rotating rapidly or by repeated blows)</td><td>4.09</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_1' data-word="drill" src='images/drill.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('drill', 'tools', 'img_1')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>axe</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la hache<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 axe</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'></span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʼaʃ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('axe', 'la hache')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 斧, 斧头</td><td class='def-en'>an edge tool with a heavy bladed head mounted across a handle</td><td>3.79</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_2' data-word="axe" src='images/axe.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('axe', 'tools', 'img_2')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>hand axe<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la biface<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 hand axe</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/hænd æks/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/bifa/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('hand axe', 'la biface')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>手斧</td><td class='def-en'>a stone tool with a cutting edge; the stone is held in the hand and used for chopping</td><td>3.78</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_3' data-word="hand axe" src='images/hand_axe.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('hand axe', 'tools', 'img_3')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
